---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What this site collects: nothing beyond standard server logs." showNav>
  <article class="wrap">
    <h1 class="disp">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This is a personal website. It is run by Dahai Tang, Berlin, Germany.</p>

      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on purpose. There are no analytics, no cookies, no tracking
        pixels, no forms, and no accounts.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served as static files by Cloudflare. Like any web host,
        Cloudflare processes your IP address and basic request data to deliver
        the page and to protect the service. I do not use that data to identify
        visitors.
      </p>

      <h2>Fonts</h2>
      <p>Fonts are served from this site. No request goes to a font provider.</p>

      <h2>The trek planner</h2>
      <p>
        The interactive trek planner runs in your browser. If you press the
        location button, your position stays on your device. If you switch on
        the topographic map layer, map tiles are loaded from an external map
        server, which then sees your IP address.
      </p>

      <h2>Links and e-mail</h2>
      <p>
        Links to LinkedIn and GitHub take you to those services, which have
        their own policies. If you e-mail me, I use your message only to reply.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:dahai.tang1@gmail.com">dahai.tang1@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  article {
    padding-block: 2.5rem 0;
  }
</style>
